" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p_stop_turn" value="ε" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.3774;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=1.0000;entryY=0.4787;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p_cstop" target="turn"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0.0" y="-14.0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_start" value="" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.5000;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.4348;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="start" target="idle"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_idle_clear" value="B0&lt;br&gt;[button &amp;amp; 0x01]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.3640;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="idle" target="clear"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-26" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_clear_search" value="[object.detected&lt;br&gt;== 0]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="clear" target="search"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-26" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_search_track" value="[object.detected]&lt;br&gt;/ first_seen_deg,&lt;br&gt;last_seen_deg,&lt;br&gt;closest_mm set" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.4219;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="search" target="track"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-40" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_track_edge" value="[scan_deg - last_seen_deg&lt;br&gt;&amp;gt;= 10]" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.3636;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.3636;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="track" target="edge_scan"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="95" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_edge_detect" value="[scan_deg &amp;lt;=&lt;br&gt;edge_start_deg - 10]&lt;br&gt;/ centre_deg = middle&lt;br&gt;of the two edges" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.3636;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.3636;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="edge_scan" target="detect"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="100" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_detect_align" value="ε&lt;br&gt;/ layout = A | B&lt;br&gt;LED1 red | yellow" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=1.0000;exitY=0.5000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0000;entryY=0.5000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="detect" target="align"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="0" y="-30" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_align_orient" value="kobuki.&lt;br&gt;rotation_complete" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.4375;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.4375;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="align" target="orient"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="80" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_orient_drive" value="kobuki.rotation_complete&lt;br&gt;/ heading = kobuki.angle, corridor = 1,&lt;br&gt;corridor_start_distance = kobuki.distance" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.1875;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.7941;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="orient" target="p_drive"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="150" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_search_phase" value="B1 | wheeldrop&lt;br&gt;| bumper | cliff" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.2018;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.2034;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="search_phase" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-62" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_search_giveup" value="give up&lt;br&gt;/ LED1 green" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.3578;exitY=1.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.3475;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="search_phase" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="52" y="0" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_align" value="B1 | wheeldrop&lt;br&gt;| bumper" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.8879;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.9619;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="align" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1515" y="214.5" /></Array><mxPoint x="-52" y="240" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_orient" value="B1 | wheeldrop&lt;br&gt;| bumper | cliff" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.8739;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.9831;entryY=0.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="orient" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="1540" y="427" /></Array><mxPoint x="58" y="122" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_fault_idle" value="ε" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0000;exitY=0.5283;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8391;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="fault" target="idle"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="233" y="708" /></Array><mxPoint x="45" y="-13" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="e_deposit_idle" value="ε&lt;br&gt;(stub: at once)" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.0500;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.2609;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="deposit" target="idle"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="48" y="-24" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_pathfind" value="B1 | wheeldrop" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.6172;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.8644;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="pathfind" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="55" y="-1.5" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="f_storage" value="B1 | wheeldrop" style="edgeStyle=none;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=7;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.25;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#b85450;labelBackgroundColor=none;align=center;exitX=0.9167;exitY=0.0000;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;exitPerimeter=0;entryX=0.0848;entryY=1.0000;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;entryPerimeter=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="storage" target="fault"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="-55" y="-1.5" as="offset" /></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dot" value="" style="ellipse;html=1;fillColor=#000000;strokeColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44" y="1476" width="16" height="16" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dot_t" value="start (initial State)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1476" width="150" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dia" value="" style="rhombus;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="230" y="1470" width="28" height="28" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_dia_t" value="choice: one trigger, the guard on each edge picks the way" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="266" y="1476" width="340" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_st" value="state" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="1470" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_fa" value="fault" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="1470" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_su" value="composite (sub-FSM)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#eeeeee;strokeColor=#666666;strokeWidth=1.5;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="1470" width="170" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_stub" value="stub" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=12;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#000000;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;dashPattern=6 3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1050" y="1470" width="90" height="30" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="lg_red" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#b85450&quot;&gt;red edge&lt;/font&gt; = fault: the State leaves for STOP / FAULT" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1170" y="1476" width="600" height="18" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note1" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read it&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A State is a rounded box: its name, then its actions. &lt;b&gt;entry /&lt;/b&gt; runs once on entering, &lt;b&gt;do /&lt;/b&gt; on every Tick in which no edge fired, &lt;b&gt;exit /&lt;/b&gt; once on leaving. Edges read: trigger [guard] / effect. A State's edges are checked in priority order and the first true one fires; a transition runs exit(), then the effect, then entry() of the next State.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;ε&lt;/b&gt; = no trigger: the edge is taken on the next Tick. One Tick = one Kobuki packet: Kobuki_Read() runs first, then the state switch.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Angles are degrees: + = ACW (left), - = CW (right) (Kobuki_Rotate: +ve is CCW). &lt;b&gt;heading&lt;/b&gt; = kobuki.angle, latched at the start of each corridor.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Setpoints (Kobuki_Rotate_Angle_Setpoint, Kobuki_Drive_Distance_Setpoint) are one-shot entry actions. kobuki.rotation_complete and kobuki.distance_complete are copied at the top of the Tick, so a State sees them one Tick after its last do / call." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1526" width="570" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note2" value="&lt;b&gt;Layouts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;A / B is the Layout saved by DETECT, never a live reading. Layout A: bollards A1/A2 block the left/top route, so the AMU takes the bottom corridor, then the right corridor; the storage wall is on its right and the ledge on its left. Layout B is the mirror image: bollards B1/B2 block the bottom/right route.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sensors&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bumper / cliff bits: right = 0x01, centre = 0x02, left = 0x04. B0 = kobuki.button &amp;amp; 0x01 (start). B1 = kobuki.button &amp;amp; 0x02 (stop). wheeldrop = kobuki.wheeldrop != 0.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Faults&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The sensor fault edge is the first edge of its State, so it wins. B1 | wheeldrop leaves every State except IDLE. The SEARCH phase States and ORIENT also fault on any bumper or cliff; ALIGN on any bumper (cliff ignored). Bumpers and cliffs are expected in PATHFIND and STORAGE, so those regions have one red edge each, for B1 | wheeldrop only. The only timeouts are the scan give-ups: CLEAR, SEARCH, TRACK and EDGE_SCAN fault with LED1 green when they find nothing." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="640" y="1526" width="570" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="note3" value="&lt;b&gt;Constants (Src/Helper/helper.h)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;path speed 100, corridor length 1200 mm, reverse 50 mm, Rotate A +10 / B -10, corner A +90 / B -90, Orient A -90 / B +90, storage turn A +135 / B -135, drive-in 1000 mm. Scan: turn speed 100 (edge scan 40), full turn 360, lost 10, give-up 40, edge band 60 mm, layout split 575 mm (B below, A otherwise). Detect range 750 mm (Src/Ultrasonic/ultrasonic.h).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Helpers (Src/Helper/helper.c)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Layout_From_Range(closest_mm) is the single split. Scan_Start() zeroes the scan; Scan_Update_Turn() adds the gyro change to scan_deg. scan_sample() and scan_give_up() are in Src/main.c.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;IDLE reset&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;IDLE clears the layout, object, heading, corridor and scan variables when B0 starts a run.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Calibration (layout split, detect range)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;The split is a calibration value (575 mm now). In the simulator B1 reads about 400 mm and A1 about 550 mm, both under 575, so the simulator classifies A as B at this value. Re-measure on the robot: face B1, then A1, from the start and read robot.object.range_mm; the split goes between them. The detect range must stay above the A1 reading and below the nearest wall." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#333333;whiteSpace=wrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1240" y="1526" width="570" height="250" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>